    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## MCP - Lichess OAuth\n\n**Description:** Workflow OAuth complet pour Lichess\n**Category:** oauth\n**Keywords:** lichess, oauth, token, discord, chess\n\n**Endpoint:** GET /webhook/lichess-oauth-callback\n\n**URL externe:** https://lichess.azy.solutions/webhook/lichess-oauth-callback\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Reçoit callback Lichess (?code&state)\n2. Récupère flow data depuis Redis (code_verifier, user_id)\n3. Échange code contre token via Lichess API\n4. Stocke token dans Redis\n5. Cleanup flow data\n6. Affiche page succès\n\n**Redis Keys:**\n- `oauth:flow:{state}` - Flow temporaire (10 min TTL)\n- `oauth:token:lichess:{user_id}` - Token stocké",
          "height": 320,
          "width": 520,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "sticky-doc",
        "name": "Documentation",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          160,
          0
        ]
      },
